# Home: visit all three pages, open the shelf from the fixed Dock twice.
@3s      snap  boot
+500ms   tap   68% 92%
+1500ms  key   home
+1500ms  tap   68% 92%
+1500ms  key   home
+1500ms  key   next
+1800ms  key   prev
+1800ms  swipe 88% 55% 15% 55% 250ms
+1800ms  key   prev
+1800ms  key   prev
+1800ms  key   next
+1800ms  key   next
+2s      snap  end
+500ms   end
